  "description": "Wrapper for the MSIX packaging toolchain from the Windows SDK: makeappx (pack/unpack) + signtool (sign/verify). Includes AppxManifest.xml version-bump helper so the Identity Version (one of the version-drift surfaces DasBook flagged) is set at build-graph time rather than hand-edited. Pairs with Tamp.Tauri.V2 / Tamp.Cargo to close the Rust-app-to-Microsoft-Store chain.",
